      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Add visible cost scale labels to cost charts",
        "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds visible, honest cost scales to every cost-chart surface while keeping token-only and partially populated widget histories unit-safe.\n\nCloses #1854.\n\n## Maintainer improvements\n\n- Detailed history uses leading currency ticks and plot-aligned date axes.\n- Inline and widget charts reserve a label gutter above the bars, so the maximum never covers the peak.\n- One shared scale model normalizes against the observed positive maximum; a `$0.50` maximum now renders as a full-height `$0.50` bar instead of using a hidden `$1` domain.\n- One shared compact currency formatter keeps sub-dollar cents and removes unnecessary decimals for whole-unit maxima.\n- Inline labels respect normal and highlighted menu contrast.\n- Widget history chooses one unit for the entire chart: cost only when every point contains cost, otherwise tokens with no currency label.\n- Invalid, zero, and negative values cannot distort the scale.\n\n## Proof\n\n- Focused chart/formatter/widget suite: 101 tests passed.\n- `make check`: SwiftFormat clean; SwiftLint 0 violations; repository checks clean.\n- Structured autoreview: clean, no actionable findings.\n- Full `make test`: all 47 shards passed on the exact head below.\n- `./Scripts/compile_and_run.sh`: release bundle packaged, relaunched, and remained running.\n- Source-blind runtime validation confirmed the fresh bundle, running process, visible in-bounds menu extra, and successful click. Pixel assertions were blocked by the host's locked secure desktop; the deterministic focused suite covers sub-dollar, zero, large-dollar, and mixed-unit fixtures.\n\nExact head: `bc5777e53ab9ecd840eb7a29172870604b238c3e`\n\n## Screenshots\n\nDetailed cost chart before the maintainer scale/gutter refinements:\n\n<img width=\"799\" height=\"600\" alt=\"Cost history with visible currency scale\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/04010ea0-0f8d-47d5-a5c0-4edb6b0b0930\" />\n\nInline and widget coverage supplied by the contributor:\n\n<img width=\"1528\" height=\"2446\" alt=\"Cost labels across CodexBar chart surfaces\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6b58f8d-4ef6-4454-b63b-3a1ce68f2772\" />\n\n## Contributor\n\nThanks @FNDEVVE for the feature direction, implementation, and visual proof.\n",
